title: Gaza and climate-protest chains

@gaza_war_2023
# prose-audit: Grade A — The opening separates solidarity with Palestinian civilians, support for Israel's war and non-alignment, then makes every line costly inside Lewica and among its rivals.
title: Gaza forces a line from the Polish Left
subtitle: Hamas's attack, Israel's siege and the first mass civilian casualties split Lewica's constituencies
face-image: img/poland/events/gaza-war-2023.webp
new-page: true
tags: poland_event
